WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Last time you were here,
you were in a film,

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:03.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
"It Comes at Night,"
which was post-apocalyptic.

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:04.070 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:06.072
-And we talked about how
you would be, personally,

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:09.242
in a post-apocalyptic situation,
and you said very bad.

00:00:09.242 --> 00:00:09.676 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:12.812
-Now you're in a spy film.
You're playing a CIA agent.

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:15.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
How would you, Joel Edgerton,
be as an actual spy?

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:16.616 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughs ]

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:20.453 size:88% position:44%
I'd be equally as bad as
my post-apocalyptic --

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:22.889 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, I was thinking about
it because, you know,

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:26.593
if you're a spy, you can't
really talk about yourself?

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:27.327 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:27.327 --> 00:00:28.061 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-And the job -- Right?

00:00:28.061 --> 00:00:32.799
And you're an actor, it's like,
how am I not supposed to brag?

00:00:32.799 --> 00:00:33.233 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:34.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, I think --
Now that you say it,

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:36.970
I don't think we've had
a single spy on the show.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:40.640 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.275 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, it would be like,
"Are you a spy?"

00:00:42.275 --> 00:00:44.244 line:92%
And I'd be like..."Yeah."

00:00:44.244 --> 00:00:45.745 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm telling you
all the things --

00:00:45.745 --> 00:00:48.481
I'm telling you all
the cool things that I've done.

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:49.716 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You know?

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:50.417 line:92%
-Well, you -- Is it true?

00:00:50.417 --> 00:00:52.786
I read that you had --
This was something you did have

00:00:52.786 --> 00:00:54.354 align:start size:94% position:6%
some curiosity for
when you were younger.

00:00:54.354 --> 00:00:57.290 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, I was totally
a spy when I was a kid.

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:58.224 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:01.061 align:start size:94% position:6%
-'Cause I lived in
a little town called Dural.

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:01.428 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Mm-hmm.

00:01:01.428 --> 00:01:04.597 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I think that's where
all the spies go

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:06.733 align:start size:94% position:6%
when they need
to, like, hide out.

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:07.267 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, really?

00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:09.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, Dural's,
like, a really tiny town.

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:11.471 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, for some reason,
I had a spy kit.

00:01:11.471 --> 00:01:12.605 line:92%
I had binoculars. I had --

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:14.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Had this been
purchased for you

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:16.443 align:start size:94% position:6%
or did you go
out and buy a spy kit?

00:01:16.443 --> 00:01:17.210 line:92%
-No. I don't know where --

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:19.712 align:start size:94% position:6%
I got the binoculars from,
like, a fair.

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:20.146 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay.

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:22.515 size:88% position:44%
-They were, like, just
tiny, little binoculars.

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:28.488
I had made a little electronic
bug, like, listening device.

00:01:28.488 --> 00:01:28.922 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, wow.

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:31.825 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I'd hollowed out a book,
and the listening device

00:01:31.825 --> 00:01:36.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
I remember using to
listen in to my grandmother,

00:01:36.663 --> 00:01:37.430 size:81% position:41% line:92%
'cause she was snoring

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:38.965 align:start size:94% position:6%
and she was living
in the room next to me.

00:01:38.965 --> 00:01:41.301 align:start size:94% position:6%
So it was like --
Maybe it was, like, a mission

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:45.171
to prove to my mother
that my grandmother was snoring

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:48.875 align:start size:94% position:6%
and that she should
move her to another room.

00:01:48.875 --> 00:01:49.542 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-So this is some --

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:51.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I successfully
completed that mission.

00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:54.781
-Wow. Oh, so you did provide
audio proof to your mother

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:55.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
that your grandmother
was a snorer.

00:01:55.849 --> 00:01:58.918
-Yeah. I mean, she's passed away
now, my grandmother.

00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:00.520 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
-I didn't...

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:02.255 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.255 --> 00:02:07.894
-Well, if -- But, again,
as a spy, you couldn't tell us.

00:02:07.894 --> 00:02:08.928 line:92%
-No, I couldn't. No, I wouldn't.

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:12.298
But I'd grab about it if I came
on your show, "theoretically."

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:13.266 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-"Theoretically."

00:02:13.266 --> 00:02:15.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:17.470 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You have --
There's a scene in the film --

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:19.172 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, like, you, obviously --
Joel Edgerton --

00:02:19.172 --> 00:02:20.440 align:start size:94% position:6%
no one would ever
have to do this to you.

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:22.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, you would give up the
information right away.

00:02:22.575 --> 00:02:25.345
But in the film, like, they
actually have to, like, strip --

00:02:25.345 --> 00:02:26.012 size:88% position:44% line:92%
There's a torture scene.

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:29.883 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're, like, stripping away
the skin, your skin.

00:02:29.883 --> 00:02:31.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-It's very hard to watch.

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:33.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
Was it hard to do?
-No.

00:02:33.653 --> 00:02:34.521 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:02:34.521 --> 00:02:36.956 align:start size:94% position:6%
The hardest scenes
to watch for an audience

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:41.961
sometimes are the most fun
things for an actor to do.

00:02:41.961 --> 00:02:42.729 size:88% position:44% line:92%
I had fun. It was weird.

00:02:42.729 --> 00:02:44.931 align:start size:94% position:6%
I spent all day
in my underpants.

00:02:44.931 --> 00:02:49.002
Actually, I spend most of
my other days in my underpants,

00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:53.373 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I have other stuff
over the top.

00:02:53.373 --> 00:02:53.940 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Just to be clear.

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:57.410 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This was an
only-underpants situation.

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:59.179 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah. Okay. Gotcha.

00:02:59.179 --> 00:03:00.380 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This was an
only-underpants situation.

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:03.783
In makeup, where I was
getting my skin peeled off me --

00:03:03.783 --> 00:03:05.785 align:start size:94% position:6%
Not for real,
'cause I'm an actor.

00:03:05.785 --> 00:03:06.419 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Right. Of course.

00:03:06.419 --> 00:03:09.355 size:88% position:44%
-I have a team of people
protecting me, for real.

00:03:09.355 --> 00:03:10.823 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Both laugh ]

00:03:10.823 --> 00:03:12.892 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They'd have to get
through so many people

00:03:12.892 --> 00:03:13.693 line:92%
to actually peel your skin.

00:03:13.693 --> 00:03:15.195 align:start size:94% position:6%
-To actually get my skin off?
-Yeah.

00:03:15.195 --> 00:03:17.530 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, but, see,
we have very thin skin.

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:18.131 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Actors.
-Actors.

00:03:18.131 --> 00:03:21.134 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Wow. This is --
-Very easily hurt.

00:03:21.134 --> 00:03:23.036 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I'll tell you something
that happened that day

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:24.137 line:92%
that was pretty funny, actually.

00:03:24.137 --> 00:03:26.773 align:start size:94% position:6%
Jennifer Lawrence...
-Yeah.

00:03:26.773 --> 00:03:28.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm just gonna
pick that one up.

00:03:28.441 --> 00:03:32.245 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, you name-dropped?
-Yeah.

00:03:32.245 --> 00:03:37.984 align:start size:94% position:6%
She...
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:37.984 --> 00:03:39.219 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, yeah, save it.

00:03:39.219 --> 00:03:39.986 line:92%
Yeah, you don't want to --

00:03:39.986 --> 00:03:42.055 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don't let me must
that up for you, yeah.

00:03:42.055 --> 00:03:44.757 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She has a little dog
called Pippi.

00:03:44.757 --> 00:03:45.425 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:03:45.425 --> 00:03:47.360 line:92%
-And Pippi's about that big.

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:50.396 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Pippi came
to her rescue that day,

00:03:50.396 --> 00:03:52.298 align:start size:94% position:6%
thought she was
really in trouble...

00:03:52.298 --> 00:03:52.732 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, wow.

00:03:52.732 --> 00:03:54.167 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...and ran onto
the set and was --

00:03:54.167 --> 00:03:58.137
And there's a big German guy,
who's torturing us -- or me.

00:03:58.137 --> 00:03:59.572 size:81% position:41% line:92%
And just decided like,

00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:03.676 align:start size:94% position:6%
"This is the guy
who's threatening mom's life.

00:04:03.676 --> 00:04:06.512 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm gonna, like --"
You know, and went at him.

00:04:06.512 --> 00:04:06.946 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, wow.

00:04:06.946 --> 00:04:10.183
-Yeah. Like, this and, you know,
he was -- It was pretty cool.

00:04:10.183 --> 00:04:13.686 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So Pippi did
a nice job, ultimately?

00:04:13.686 --> 00:04:15.421 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Better job than me.

00:04:15.421 --> 00:04:19.158
-It takes a man to say that.
It takes a man to admit that.

